{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"HttpWalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"class","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"roleHeading":"Class","externalID":"s:12OID4VCWallet18HttpWalletProviderC","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"HttpWalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"HttpWalletProvider","role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InstanceRegistry","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileInstanceRegistry","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryInstanceRegistry","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/RegisteredInstance","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/AppAttestService","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeviceAppAttestService","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/AppAttestKeyLostError","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProviderRefusedError"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"HttpWalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The installation registers once, at its first Wallet Attestation:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"over a ","type":"text"},{"code":"registration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" challenge, it makes a ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"registration key"}]},{"text":" in a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key store of its own ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/registrationKeyStore()"},{"type":"text","text":") and an App Attest"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key, has Apple attest the App Attest key over the client data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"naming the registration key, registers both ("},{"code":"POST \/v1\/instances","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and keeps the instance ID and the two keys’ IDs in its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InstanceRegistry"},{"type":"text","text":". The registration key signs every later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request ("},{"code":"Wallet-Provider-Request","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"); no attestation names it. If"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the registration, its key or the App Attest key is lost, the next"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Wallet Attestation registers again, with new keys. An App Attest"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key a registration made but couldn’t register — App Attest’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"server or the provider unavailable, or no connection — is kept, in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this process, and tried again by the next registration, as Apple"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asks; it’s dropped when the provider or App Attest refuses it."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/walletAttestation(clientID:instanceKey:)"},{"type":"text","text":" asks for a Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Attestation for the instance key ("},{"code":"instance_key","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). The first time,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it sends an App Attest assertion over a fresh "},{"code":"instance","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" challenge"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the key, which the provider records the key with; once it has,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the key alone — and the assertion again if the provider no longer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has its record ("},{"code":"evidence_required","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/keyAttestation(instanceKey:keys:nonce:)"},{"type":"text","text":" asks for a Key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Attestation over the holder keys, with one assertion over a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"holder","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" challenge and all of them, for the issuance of its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instance key, which a Wallet Attestation recorded."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"App Attest attests the app, not the wallet’s keys: the provider"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"learns that a genuine copy of the app on a genuine Apple device asked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for them, not where they are. Make them in the Secure Enclave all the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s default). Where App Attest isn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"supported — the Simulator, some older devices — the wallet can’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"register, and every attestation fails as "},{"code":".platform","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": there’s no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unattested path, in development either. A development build (the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"com.apple.developer.devicecheck.appattest-environment","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set to "},{"code":"development","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") makes development-environment keys, which only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a provider configured for them accepts."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Assertions are made one at a time, each sent before the next is made,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as the provider accepts only an assertion whose counter exceeds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"last it took, and the installation registers once. Every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"HttpWalletProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" over the same "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileInstanceRegistry"},{"type":"text","text":" file (or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryInstanceRegistry"},{"type":"text","text":") in the process shares that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order, so a wallet rebuilt mid-issuance with a new provider is still"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"serialised with the old one. Over a registry of its own type, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provider serialises only its own calls: keep one provider for it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It sends nothing but to its base URL, over https, following no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redirect, with its timeout for each request, and reads at most"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"256 KiB of an answer. It checks a Wallet Attestation is for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"client and the instance key, and a Key Attestation is over the nonce"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sent and attests only keys sent; their signatures are the issuer’s to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"verify."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Failures reach the wallet as "},{"code":"WalletError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"s: one the network or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provider’s availability caused (no connection, a timeout, HTTP 5xx or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"429, a challenge that expired before it was used, App Attest’s server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unavailable) as "},{"code":".network","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which may be retried"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProviderUnavailableError"},{"type":"text","text":"); a refusal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProviderRefusedError"},{"type":"text","text":") as "},{"code":".platform","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", its message naming the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"protocol’s error code. On "},{"code":"instance_revoked","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", it forgets the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"registration and deletes its registration key: the next Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Attestation registers the installation again. The revoked instance’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instance keys stay its own ("},{"code":"instance_key_registered","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential whose refresh needs one must be received again. On"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"instance_not_active","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (suspended) it keeps the registration: tell the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder, as the provider may resume it. A signed request refused as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"invalid_signed_request","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" isn’t retried: check the device’s clock, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"that the provider still knows the instance.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" over the Wallet Provider HTTP protocol, version"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"1, that OID4VCgo’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"walletprovider.Provider.Handler"},{"type":"text","text":" serves"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo\/blob\/main\/mobile\/WALLET_PROVIDER.md"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with Apple App Attest ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"apple-app-attest"},{"type":"text","text":") as its evidence:"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/httpwalletprovider"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/init(baseURL:instances:registrationKeys:appAttest:timeout:)"],"generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/keyAttestation(instanceKey:keys:nonce:)","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/sweepOrphanedRegistrationKeys()","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/walletAttestation(clientID:instanceKey:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/defaultTimeout","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvi